Amazing! There's still 30 seconds left!
We can time the last throw with a countdown!

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:38.720
Knife...

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:40.600
Huh? What's that?

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.430
I threw all of 'em.

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:43.350
What?

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:45.890
What?!

00:16:49.890 --> 00:16:54.850
What now?! At this rate, we're doomed!

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:56.020
Huh?

00:16:58.060 --> 00:17:00.180
Here's the last one!

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:01.600
Ten seconds left.

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:02.640
--Mr. Hacker! I'm borrowing a drone!

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:04.470
--Huh? I told you, no!
--Mr. Hacker! I'm borrowing a drone!

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:07.810
Okay! Leave the switch to me!

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:10.520
Go!

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:12.850
Three seconds.

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:15.270
Two! One!

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:22.430
Ow, ow, ow... Huh?

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:24.600
We did it!

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.930
Now we can get to the platform!

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:28.560
My knife...

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:30.140
My drone...

00:17:32.430 --> 00:17:33.930
Hmm?

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:36.970
I was worried you guys didn't pull it off.

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:42.100
If the elevator moved, we obviously did.
How dumb can you be?

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:43.100
Huh?

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:45.180
What are you doing?

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:46.970
Let's get moving!

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:48.850
Uh, right!

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:57.810
"<i>Shinkansen </i>Platform"

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:07.220
It's so big! So this is the <i>Shinkansen</i>!

00:18:07.220 --> 00:18:11.930
We're not here to sightsee.
We need to hurry and get inside.

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:15.430
Good point! Mr. Hoodlum, it's time for "that"!

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:17.930
Huh? Oh!

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:19.680
What is this even?

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:22.600
It's something I brought from Kyushu Plant.

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:22.930
"Safety First"

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:24.810
"Safety First"
But what is it?

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:28.600
"Safety First"
It will disable the platform's
electromagnetic barrier.

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:32.770
"Safety First"
With this, Courier can
drive right in, bike and all.

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:35.720
I'll go as soon as the barrier's down.

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:37.100
Please do.

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:42.810
Hacker. Once you get inside the <i>Shinkansen</i>
and disable the plasma field--

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:45.470
Everyone can rush on board.

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:51.060
Yes. And that completes our
invasion of Kansai Station.

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:55.310
The fate of the entire plan rests upon my hand!

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:56.100
--We push this, right?

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:57.680
--W-Wait!
--We push this, right?

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:05.970
"Hope"

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:08.060
"Hope"

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:13.020
The signal.

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:16.680
"Emergency"

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:18.180
--This is...!
--Red lights, so pretty!

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:19.890
--I've got a bad feeling.
--Red lights, so pretty!

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:24.310
Due to an emergency, the <i>Shinkansen</i>
will depart in 60 seconds.

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:27.350
Finish loading cargo immediately.

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:28.680
I repeat...

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:32.430
No way! Hacker, hurry and get inside!

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:37.470
My power got cut off, too.
I wasn't able to modify all the data.

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:39.520
Huh? You mean...?

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:44.020
Even if I get in the box,
the shield will turn me to dust.

00:19:44.020 --> 00:19:47.140
You're kidding! Courier is already--

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:52.680
There's still hope.

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:53.470
Huh?

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:57.140
The only value I hadn't
overwritten was the weight.

00:19:57.140 --> 00:20:02.180
The original contents weigh less
than I do, so I won't clear the check.

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:05.220
But if it's someone who's lighter than me...

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:08.560
The only one who might weigh less...

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:14.560
I'll do it!

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:18.140
Are you sure you weigh less than me?

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:21.720
Only jerks ask girls about their weight!

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:47.890
Whoa!

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:51.220
Um, um...!

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:52.060
"Six"
Um, um...!

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.470
Um, um...!

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:54.770
There!

00:20:58.890 --> 00:21:01.430
C'mon!

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:11.890
Move... you... shit...!

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:18.850
Perfect.

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:22.930
Thank goodness!

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:33.220
You're kidding!

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:35.970
But this is Kansai Station!

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:41.020
Emergency start.

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:51.310
The <i>Shinkansen </i>starting was unexpected,
but that's one challenge cleared.

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:53.720
Now then...

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:56.350
The real challenge starts now.

00:23:44.850 --> 00:23:46.930
Who in the world are you guys?
